 absorb energy directed at them as  well as store it  the axe could very well be a shield too  as  it could be used to defend against the  atomic breath and since kong has been  seen improvising with trees  propellers and chains as weapons he  could very well go  caveman style on the g-man with the axe  now number three godzilla's design now  going to the g-man his design will be  mostly similar to the king of the  monsters version  as not much has happened to him since  then in the previous movie we saw  godzilla grow taller and bulkier in  appearance as compared to the 2014  version  his dorsal plates have also grown more  and the four limbs as well as  legs seem to be more muscular and  prominent in the leaked clip  we saw the same godzilla but with again  minor changes that a few have noticed  most noticeably the more prominent and  even larger dorsal plates  but that might just be a glitch in the  system who knows  but also if you look closely his neck  seems to be shorter and stockier  but the toy designs show the same 2019  design so we will just have to wait and  see  then we have mega godzilla one  surprising toy figure revealed to us  bears the name  mega godzilla and it's not just directed  at the increase in size of the g-man  in fact it has a weird exoskeleton  covering him that  is red in color and seems to be grown  around him  it bears no resemblance to any past  designs  and there has never actually been  prosthetics or armor given to godzilla  in the past movies  it kinda looks like the parts of mecca  godzilla which we shall discuss later in  the video  and it seems that it was added to  godzilla maybe for power enhancement  or maybe he got into a great injury and  the only thing that would help  him up again against another opponent is  for the red exoskeleton to combine with  him  but that's just our theory the reason  for it the presence of this mega  godzilla toy however  brings a lot of questions for the movie  number five the alpha skull crawler  so up next we have the big skull crawler  an even bigger specimen than the one  that fought kong in the final scenes of  the 2017 kong skull island movie  this one is a large reptilian creature  and with only  2-4 limbs and no high limbs as well as a  long prehensile serpentine tail  you know the story just like its smaller  minions as we have done a video of the  three titans confirmed for gvk  we will make this short we'll call it  the alpha skull crawler  as it has reddish skin on it and it  starts from the base of the head  and the neck and goes backwards this  alpha also has  bigger arms with more musculature and  seems to be half the height of godzilla  but equal in length  but that's just a toy figure comparison  but again  imagine this beast fight with godzilla  rather than kong  seems like a battle worth watching next  we have the hollow  earth anti-gravity vehicle alongside the  giant skullcrawler we have a small  vehicle that was  a part of the toy figure and it was  named the heav  which is short for hollow earth  anti-gravity vehicle  as we all know ever since the 2017 skull  island movie  that the planet has huge underground  cavities that are theorized to contain  more titans and monsters in them  it was made true with the seismology  readings and the emergence of the skull  crawlers  and also in kotm when we found that  godzilla uses these cavities to travel  in and out around the seas of the planet  and there was also an ancient  civilization trap in the depths  so this heav is like the underwater  version of the argo of kotm  which would be used to travel the depths  of the hollow earth and since going down  would also see  the effect of gravity lessen the use of  anti-gravity like  the human ships in the matrix trilogy  films will be seen  before we continue on with the other  three updates for godzilla vs gong don't  forget to check out our merchandise on  dspring.com  so going up to number seven we have  nozuki or the warbap  so this island appears to be a winged  serpent-like creature with yellow and  red colored wings  see these updates are mostly from league  clips and toy league images so forgive  us if legendary pulls  them back and says no we will give them  other titans for the movie  but if the nazuki is closely inspected  we would see that the serpent has  strange wings that just  juts out from the sides and it comes out  from the spines of the creature like  the frills of the dilophosaurus in the  first jurassic park film  these wings are mostly used for either  gliding or for intimidation  and not for flying but we could end up  being surprised after all  godzilla can self-detonate and survive  this warbat or nuzuki will be the most  interesting talent to see in the  upcoming movie  then we get to mecca godzilla so as we  have seen in the credit scenes of kotm  monarch was actively building a  mechanized island in order to face off  against the other organic titans threat  that humanity suddenly faced  in the recent years it wouldn't be  far-fetched since mechagodzilla has been  a staple in the godzilla franchise and  is one of the recurring enemies faced by  the g-man  did you know that the head of ghidorah  in the past has been salvaged and used  to build  make a godzilla with it well we all know  that there is still  one head of monster zero in isla de mara  so  in the league toy images we can see that  there is in fact a mecha godzilla and it  has a very  different design although not really as  different as mecha godzilla city yeah  this mega godzilla had robust arms and  legs and that the hands were like clamps  that would likely be clenched to form a  powerful fist or grab  godzilla's neck this mecha also had  a long reddish spine and tail which  could be nuclear batteries for powering  the  titan and its attacks and lastly we have  the release date  the film was previously shared to be  released in may 29  then may 22nd pre-phone then pre-pawn to  max  then pre-pawn to march 13 202